    ├── OrderJpaRepository
    ├── OrderReadRepository
    └── OutboxRepository
You don't need separate applications initially.
First establish:
separate responsibilities
Then scale the physical architecture only when required.
________________________________________
38. A useful evolution path
This is how I'd prefer a real system to evolve.
Phase 1
Spring Boot
PostgreSQL
Simple CRUD/domain model.
________________________________________
Phase 2
Business complexity grows.
Introduce:
Command handlers
Query handlers
but still:
same PostgreSQL
________________________________________
