37. Where snapshots fit
Now you can understand snapshots properly.
Without snapshot:
E1 → E2 → E3 → ... → E1,000,000
                         ↓
                      State
With snapshot:
E1 → E2 → ... → E900,000
                    ↓
                 Snapshot
                    ↓
