Traditional CRUD gives you:
Current State
Event Sourcing gives you:
History
But now you have to build:
History
   ↓
reconstruction mechanism
   ↓
current state
So Event Sourcing essentially changes the fundamental storage equation from:
Write state → Read state
to:
Write history → Reconstruct state
That trade-off is the heart of the architecture.
