51. A concrete Java example
Imagine:
record AccountSnapshot(
    long streamVersion,
    BigDecimal balance,
    AccountStatus status
) {}
Loading:
AccountSnapshot snapshot =
    snapshotStore.load("account-123");

Account account;

if (snapshot != null) {
    account = Account.restore(
        snapshot.balance(),
        snapshot.status()
    );
} else {
    account = Account.empty();
}

long version =
    snapshot == null
        ? 0
        : snapshot.streamVersion();

List<Event> events =
    eventStore.loadAfter(
        "account-123",
        version
    );

for (Event event : events) {
    account.apply(event);
}
Suppose:
snapshot version = 1000
and:
current event version = 1030
Only:
1001 ... 1030
need replaying.
