50. Failure matrix
Component	Failure	Can writes continue?	Recovery
Event Store	unavailable	Usually no	retry/fail command
Command Service	crash	yes, retry command	idempotency
Kafka	unavailable	ideally yes	relay retries
Projection	unavailable	yes	replay/catch up
Read DB	unavailable	usually yes	projection recovery
Analytics	unavailable	yes	replay
Notification	unavailable	yes	retry
Consumer	crash	yes	checkpoint + retry
Bad event	permanent failure	depends	DLQ/quarantine
Concurrent command	conflict	yes	reload/retry/reject
This table is worth memorizing conceptually.
