36. The most important failure table
Failure	What you know	Safe action
Request never reached server	definitely not executed	retry
Server rejected validation	definitely not executed	return failure
DB committed, response lost	operation succeeded	return stored result
External API returned success	operation succeeded	persist success
External API returned business failure	operation failed	persist failure
External API timed out	unknown	query/reconcile before retrying
JVM crashed after external success	unknown locally	recover/query provider
Same key arrives concurrently	one operation should win	atomic DB claim
Kafka event redelivered	same logical event	idempotent consumer
DB rolled back after external success	external effect may exist	reconcile
Idempotency record expired too early	duplicate may look new	choose retention carefully
